        "TileImage": "$($repository 577a77ba-a705-463f-9a51-7490ec9625e2).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Ireland 47!\rYour next targets are four members of the so-called counter-terrorism unit of an ex-Eastern European prime minister and self-proclaimed dictator who was recently ousted from power. These four members of the counter-terrorism unit were the most trusted bodyguards of the vindicted PM, and they orchestrated numerous illegal blackmailing, interrogation, and assassination activities. The men now work private security for a far-right think tank. Make them pay. Good luck 47!",
